Package: python3-colcon-mission-control
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-colcon-core
Description: live web dashboard for colcon builds
 Colcon Mission Control serves a single-page dashboard for a colcon
 workspace: a state-colored dependency graph with layered, force, and 3D
 layouts, a Gantt timeline, isolated per-package log panes with terminal
 colors, and CPU, RAM, and swap meters with a per-core heatmap.
 .
 The package registers a colcon plugin. Enable it for one build with
 --event-handlers mission_control+ or for every build with
 COLCON_MISSION_CONTROL=1, or start the dashboard by hand with the
 colcon-mission-control command.
